Challenges:
- had to make sure to first create an np.zeros array that is the size for all hidden layers combined for self.model_activations in 
order to modify arrays in-place. Initially when I implemented self.model_activations, I created an empty array and planned to append
each activation layer individually to self.model_activations. HOWEVER, np arrays have immutable allocation of memory, so np.append 
returns a different array than the original one. So for the sake of memory optimization, rather than appending to it, allocated 
memory via creating np.zeros array of final array size, and created self.model_activations_idx variable to track idx when appending
to self.model_array during forward pass.
    - same thing for self.cached_z array!
    - changed np arrays of self.model_activations and self.cached_z via index slicing rather than iterating thru individual elements

